# Costume Closet: "Whenever a modified creature you control leaves the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on this artifact." Bot1's Ornithopter
# has no counter, no Equipment and no Aura (CR 700.9), so when Bot2 exiles it with Swords to Plowshares nothing triggers: the Closet keeps
# its two counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Costume Closet
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Costume Closet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Costume Closet.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Stack.Count = 0
